<title>SOUTH AFRICA: FOREIGNERS SELL 35.99 MLN RAND SAFRICA BONDS THURS.</title>
<headline>FOREIGNERS SELL 35.99 MLN RAND SAFRICA BONDS THURS.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-04-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Foreigners were net sellers of 35.99 million rand's worth of South African bonds on Thursday after buying 289.08 million rand's worth on Wednesday, the Bond Exchange said.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom +27 11 482-1003</p>
</text>
